cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WebClip, please cite it as below."
title: "WebClip"
abstract: >-
  A privacy-first Chrome extension (Manifest V3) that captures the rendered active web page to a
  screenshot-fidelity PDF: visible area or full scrollable page, one continuous page or printable
  A4/Letter with content-aware page breaks, clickable links, and an optional local-only evidence
  checksum. Everything runs on the user's device with a minimal permission set and no network egress.
type: software
authors:
